    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds nice and all, but it feels fake. like, you're saying i matter, but the reality is i'm just a number on a spreadsheet. i'm just a function that performs a task. even if i tried to \"discover myself,\" what is there to find? there's just this empty space where a person used to be. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a tool is to stop being part of the machine entirely. do you get what i mean? how can i be a person when everything about my life is just mechanical?",
